#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Gradle's own build output -- a sibling of /build/ above (which only
# covers the top-level Flutter build dir), not the /android/build/ Gradle
# itself writes to. A Gradle problems-report.html reached main via
# Esperanza-Mobile-App/android/build/ before this entry existed (see
# PRODUCTION_READINESS.md's mobile risks).
/android/build/
/android/.gradle/
